// REQUIRES: system-spirv-as
//
// RUN: %spirv-as --target-env vulkan1.0 %S/Inputs/const-offset-bias-sample.spvasm -o %t.spv
//
// Roadmap L35(a): `--import-spirv` (this project's own standard
// real-IR-reduction tool, see feme/docs/Design.md's "Testing Tools"
// section) crashes on any real SPIR-V binary using the `ConstOffset`/
// `Offset`/`ConstOffsets`/`MinLod`/etc. image operands, via an upstream
// MLIR SPIR-V dialect op verifier assert in mlir/lib/Dialect/SPIRV/IR/
// ImageOps.cpp's verifyImageOperands (a literal "TODO: Add the validation
// rules for the following Image Operands" comment followed by an
// unconditional `assert(!bitEnumContainsAny(...))`), hit whenever
// `mlir::verify()` runs against a module using one of these operands in an
// assertions-enabled build (this project's own standard build
// configuration). `--import-spirv-skip-verify` (added by this row) skips
// that verification (and prints the module with `OpPrintingFlags`'s own
// `assumeVerified()`, since `Operation::print` would otherwise
// independently re-trigger the identical assert while deciding whether to
// fall back to generic op form) so a real repro using these operands can
// still be reduced through this tool.
//
// This input can't be produced by round-tripping MLIR's own `spirv`
// dialect textual syntax through `feme-translate` (e.g.
// `--serialize-spirv`) -- parsing that text hits the exact same
// unconditional `mlir::verify()` call via `parseSourceFileForTool`,
// independent of any import/export path -- so it is assembled directly
// from real SPIR-V assembly via `spirv-as` instead. No binary fixture is
// checked in, per "Avoiding binary test fixtures" in feme/docs/Design.md.

// The known upstream gap still crashes the default (verifying) path --
// pinned here so a future upstream fix resolving ImageOps.cpp's own TODO
// is noticed (this RUN line would then fail with "expected crash but did
// not").
// RUN: not --crash feme-translate --import-spirv %t.spv 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=CRASH
// CRASH: unimplemented operands of Image Operands

// RUN: feme-translate --import-spirv --import-spirv-skip-verify %t.spv | FileCheck %s
// CHECK: spirv.ImageSampleImplicitLod {{.*}} ["Bias|ConstOffset"]
